            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ido koany, ajeni ebe iraun ijo ekabaka, iticasio ajakanut naka Isirael kakanikon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aso ca kiyapoikinoi kolimite EJAKAIT, ebe mam jo imudiari akaur nakatupanakini, ebe da mam imudiari ekakiror kokek loka papaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyapoik Daudi Saul. Kolot Saul ore; konye kolototo Daudi ka iketuŋa abua.",
          "type": "text",
